Truigev
$cards
DECK 2 {SPADES, HEARTS, CLUBS, DIAMONDS}

$initial
DRAW 86 ROTATE 3 U 3
COLUMN 5 FACE_HALF
COLUMN 3 FACE_HALF
COLUMN 0 FACE_HALF
COLUMN 1 FACE_LAST
COLUMN 4 FACE_LAST
COLUMN 5 FACE_LAST

$moves
MOVE COLUMN COLUMN
OR
    DEST Empty
    AND
        DEST Empty
        SRC Rank 1
MOVE DRAW COLUMN
DEST Suit {CLUBS, SPADES, DIAMONDS, HEARTS}
$win
OR
    PILE ALL DRAW Empty
    PILE ALL COLUMN Empty
